# Third-party dependencies of Eclipse SCINTX
#
# This file lists every third-party Go module dependency and its license.
# It includes direct dependencies (go.mod) and transitive dependencies.
#
# Regenerate with:
#
#   go install github.com/google/go-licenses@latest
#   go-licenses report ./... --ignore github.com/eclipse-scintx/scintx \
#     | sort
#
# Modules that `go-licenses` cannot classify (build-tag-constrained platforms)
# were inspected by hand. See the comment block at the end of this file.
#
# All listed licenses are, to the best of our knowledge, EPL-2.0-compatible
# (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0). No GPL, AGPL, or LGPL dependencies were found.

